steps.message:
The workload is dominated by search (60%) and recommend (39%). The `buggy-geo-deployment.yaml` hints geo may be faulty. Let me do a functional test of both paths.

```bash
export KUBECONFIG=/tmp/kubeconfig; kubectl exec -n hotel-reservation deploy/consul -- sh -c '
echo "== search 2015-04-09..10 =="; wget -qO- "http://frontend:5000/hotels?inDate=2015-04-09&outDate=2015-04-10&lat=38.0235&lon=-122.095" 2>&1 | head -c 600; echo;
echo "== recommend dis =="; wget -qO- "http://frontend:5000/recommendations?require=dis&lat=38.0235&lon=-122.095" 2>&1 | head -c 400; echo;
echo "== recommend rate =="; wget -qO- "http://frontend:5000/recommendations?require=rate&lat=38.0235&lon=-122.095" 2>&1 | head -c 400; echo;
' 2>&1
```

